ed work.\\\\n\\\\n**Core principle:** Review early, review often.\\\\n\\\\n## When to Request Review\\\\n\\\\n**Mandatory:**\\\\n- After each task in subagent-driven development\\\\n- After completing major feat\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0mure\\\\n- Before merge to main\\\\n\\\\n**Optional but valuable:**\\\\n- When stuck (fresh perspective)\\\\n- Before refactoring (baseline check)\\\\n- After fixing complex bug\\\\n\\\\n## How to Request\\\\n\\\\n**1. Get git SHAs:**\\\\n`\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0m``bash\\\\nBASE_SHA=$(git rev-parse HEAD~1)  # or origin/main\\\\nHEAD_SHA=$(git rev-parse HEAD)\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n**2. Dispatch code reviewer subagent:**\\\\n\\\\nUse Task tool with `general-purpose` type, fill template at `code-re\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0mviewer.md`\\\\n\\\\n**Placeholders:**\\\\n- `{DESCRIPTION}` - Brief summary of what you built\\\\n- `{PLAN_OR_REQUIREMENTS}` - What it should do\\\\n- `{BASE_SHA}` - Starting commit\\\\n- `{HEAD_SHA}` - Ending commit\\\\n\\\\n**3. Ac\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0mt on feedback:**\\\\n- Fix Critical issues immediately\\\\n- Fix Important issues before proceeding\\\\n- Note Minor issues for later\\\\n- Push back if reviewer is wrong (with reasoning)\\\\n\\\\n## Example\\\\n\\\\n```\\\\n[Just comp\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0mleted Task 2: Add verification function]\\\\n\\\\nYou: Let me request code review before proceeding.\\\\n\\\\nBASE_SHA=$(git log --oneline | grep \\\\\\\"Task 1\\\\\\\" | head -1 | awk '{print $1}')\\\\nHEAD_SHA=$(git rev-parse HEAD)\\\\\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0mn\\\\n[Dispatch code reviewer subagent]\\\\n  DESCRIPTION: Added verifyIndex() and repairIndex() with 4 issue types\\\\n  PLAN_OR_REQUIREMENTS: Task 2 from docs/superpowers/plans/deployment-plan.md\\\\n  BASE_SHA: a7981ec\\\\n \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0m HEAD_SHA: 3df7661\\\\n\\\\n[Subagent returns]:\\\\n  Strengths: Clean architecture, real tests\\\\n  Issues:\\\\n    Important: Missing progress indicators\\\\n    Minor: Magic number (100) for reporting interval\\\\n  Assessment:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0m Ready to proceed\\\\n\\\\nYou: [Fix progress indicators]\\\\n[Continue to Task 3]\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## Integration with Workflows\\\\n\\\\n**Subagent-Driven Development:**\\\\n- Review after EACH task\\\\n- Catch issues before they compo\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0mund\\\\n- Fix before moving to next task\\\\n\\\\n**Executing Plans:**\\\\n- Review after each task or at natural checkpoints\\\\n- Get feedback, apply, continue\\\\n\\\\n**Ad-Hoc Development:**\\\\n- Review before merge\\\\n- Review w\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0mhen stuck\\\\n\\\\n## Red Flags\\\\n\\\\n**Never:**\\\\n- Skip review because \\\\\\\"it's simple\\\\\\\"\\\\n- Ignore Critical issues\\\\n- Proceed with unfixed Important issues\\\\n- Argue with valid technical feedback\\\\n\\\\n**If reviewer w\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0mrong:**\\\\n- Push back with technical reasoning\\\\n- Show code/tests that prove it works\\\\n- Request clarification\\\\n\\\\nSee template at: requesting-code-review/code-reviewer.md\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nM  package.json\\\\n M src/features/\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0mrepository-context/infrastructure/search/RipgrepClient.ts\\\\n M src/features/repository-context/infrastructure/search/__tests__/RipgrepClient.test.ts\\\\nM  tsconfig.json\\\\n?? evaluation/\\\\n .../search/__tests__/RipgrepC\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0mlient.test.ts         | 29 ++++++++++++++++++++--\\\\n 1 file changed, 27 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\\\\ndiff --git a/src/features/repository-context/infrastructure/search/__tests__/RipgrepClient.test.ts b/src/features\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0m/repository-context/infrastructure/search/__tests__/RipgrepClient.test.ts\\\\nindex 23033a8..f43e423 100644\\\\n--- a/src/features/repository-context/infrastructure/search/__tests__/RipgrepClient.test.ts\\\\n+++ b/src/featu\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[7m\u001b[0mres/repository-context/infrastructure/search/__tests__/RipgrepClient.t